  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 0／NC State・種] See the four listed sterile cultivars.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] MBG は 1 相当、MBG は 3 相当\n[地下茎 3／NC State・種] Chinese fountain grass can spread rapidly by seeds carried by wind or by attaching to clothes or fur.",
